Error [E0109]: Only an optional value can be compared with `None`, but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/ne_none_non_optional.jet:5:8
    |
  5 |     if count != None {
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A value whose type isn't optional is never None, so this comparison is always true
 Fix: Remove the comparison, or give the value an optional type such as `Int?` if it can be missing
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0109
